| SAME         | CONTINUATION |   ... |
| SAME         | UNWITNESSED  |   ... |
| DERIVED-FROM | CONTINUATION |   ... |
| DERIVED-FROM | UNWITNESSED  |   ... |
| ...          | ...          |   ... |

Then determine whether disagreement is:

* random
